      "widgets_values": [
        "## Flow PT — start here\n\nTwo halves. Run one at a time.\n\n**Publish.** Pick a **project** and a **link** on the Publish node, then Run. It makes a test card,\ncreates a Version in Flow PT from it, and the panel names that Version before you press anything.\n\n**Load.** Now pick the same project and link on the Load node and Run again. It reads back the\nVersion you just made.\n\nNo model, no download, and nothing written to disk: **Create Published Files** is off. Turn it on\nonce your profile names a storage."
